  "description": "Proposed extension to the office outbuilding located in the pubs beer garden to accommodate two toilets serving the pub.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The extension to the outbuilding would, by reason of its depth, height and position on the western boundary of the site, be an unneighbourly development and appear dominant and visually intrusive in the rear garden environment harmful to the amenity of adjacent occupiers, particularly No. 99 Brentwood Road contrary to Policy 7 of the Havering Local Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Statement Required by Article 35 (2) of the Town and Country Planning (Development Management Procedure) (England) Order 2015: Consideration was given to seeking amendments, but given conflict with adopted planning policy, notification of intended refusal and the reason(s) for it was given to Kyson Design Ltd via email on 4th June 2026."
